<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal non-tradable goods prices up 4.8 pct Feb.</title>
<headline>Portugal non-tradable goods prices up 4.8 pct Feb.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese non-tradable goods prices rose 4.8 percent year-on-year in February, compared with 5.1 percent year-on-year in January, the National Statistics Institute said.</p>
</text>
